content.thinking:
Now the C1 fix - the ring tracing. Replace the `trace_on_ring` lambda with a directional-continuation version that avoids visited pixels and picks by direction cosine (like PickNextPixel). Let me also make sure we handle the case where we should trace in both directions from n_a to n_b.

Current code:
```cpp
      // 在环上从 n_a 沿两个方向 BFS/追踪到 n_b。简化：直接追踪有序路径。
      // 构造环像素的相邻列表，然后从 n_a 走两条方向到 n_b。
      auto trace_on_ring = [&](const Pixel& from, const Pixel& first,
                               const Pixel& target) {
        std::vector<Pixel> path{from, first};
        Pixel prev = from;
        Pixel cur = first;
        const size_t limit = ring.size() + 8;
        while (!(cur == target) && path.size() <= limit) {
          // 选非 prev 的环邻居
          Pixel next{-1, -1};
          int found = 0;
          for (int i = 0; i < 8; ++i) {
            const Pixel nb{cur.col + kDCol[i], cur.row + kDRow[i]};
            if (nb == prev) continue;
            if (!skeleton.GetValue(nb.col, nb.row)) continue;
            if (std::find(ring.begin(), ring.end(), nb) == ring.end()) continue;
            next = nb;
            ++found;
          }
          if (found == 0) break;
          prev = cur;
          cur = next;
          path.push_back(cur);
        }
        return path;
      };
```

The bug: `next = nb` overwrites on every match, so it picks the LAST matching neighbor in kD order. On a ring, this can bounce back (e.g., to a neighbor that leads back where we came from via a diagonal).Fix: maintain a visited set for this path, exclude visited, and among unvisited ring neighbors pick the one with max direction cosine (continuation). Reuse PickNextPixel.

Note: `std::find(ring.begin(), ring.end(), nb)` is O(ring) per check - inefficient but fine for test-sized rings; better to build an unordered_set once. Let me build a ring_set for efficiency and correctness.

Let me rewrite:

```cpp
      // 在环上从 n_a 沿两个方向追踪到 n_b。
      // 关键修复（C1）：纯环上每个像素都是"中段"（crossing==2），不能按
      // "最后一个匹配邻居"选向——那会在拐角处取到反方向邻居导致来回震荡、
      // 永远到不了 n_b。改为维护本条路径的 visited 集合，在未访问的环邻居
      // 中按来向方向余弦最大者续行（与 PickNextPixel 一致：直线延续优先，
      // 内侧对角捷径不会抢先），保证两条半环路径不重叠且完整覆盖整环。
      std::unordered_set<Pixel, PixelHash> ring_set(ring.begin(), ring.end());
      auto trace_on_ring = [&](const Pixel& from, const Pixel& first,
                               const Pixel& target) {
        std::vector<Pixel> path{from, first};
        std::unordered_set<Pixel, PixelHash> visited;
        visited.insert(from);
        visited.insert(first);
        Pixel prev = from;
        Pixel cur = first;
        const size_t limit = ring.size() + 8;
        while (!(cur == target) && path.size() <= limit) {
          // 收集未访问的环邻居（排除 prev）
          std::vector<Pixel> candidates;
          for (int i = 0; i < 8; ++i) {
            const Pixel nb{cur.col + kDCol[i], cur.row + kDRow[i]};
            if (nb == prev || visited.count(nb) > 0) continue;
            if (ring_set.count(nb) == 0) continue;
            candidates.push_back(nb);
          }
          if (candidates.empty()) break;
          // 按来向方向余弦挑选主续像素：直线延续优先于对角捷径，杜绝          // 在环拐角处反向震荡。
          const Pixel next = PickNextPixel(prev, cur, candidates, visited);
          if (next.col == -1) break;
          visited.insert(next);
          prev = cur;
          cur = next;
          path.push_back(cur);
        }
        return path;
      };
